{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:3/32/mx98hk4j9pkjexyzele3ffkxxa34dov.mp3","text":"博士，老夫非常敬佩你的胆识，很荣幸担任你的护卫。","alt":"voice_cn/char_503_rang/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:d/de/bm9cop7ra11tap5b8ngpky1rcv1jezk.mp3","text":"老夫不会看错人的，将来，博士您一定会成为一位出色的领导人。","alt":"voice_cn/char_503_rang/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/4a/7b137c4gxwnujlzyds35t6f1jmywe5n.mp3","text":"老夫我这样的体色很稀有吧？哈哈，那是在以前，潜入一间生化实验室的时候......哈，开玩笑的，开玩笑。","alt":"voice_cn/char_503_rang/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/3c/rik7fdjg84yhqzjibsc9jrkn80g32nq.mp3","text":"老夫我睡觉的时候也得戴着这条围巾，不然脖子啊，会着凉的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_503_rang/cn_004.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:9/93/9dr0qah1r0ohy6oumpjwfaf9b3m5pyy.mp3","text":"老夫这幅样貌，对一些偏僻小镇的居民来说实在是太稀奇了。呵，招来一些异样的目光也是没办法的事。","alt":"voice_cn/char_503_rang/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/75/47q3k1fhbuan91dahq2h9xnvjf4fzst.mp3","text":"没想到博士竟然这么在意老夫，除了杜林，可很少有人这样追问我平日里过的怎么样了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_503_rang/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a3/12tudzfv7llch391vwyhpgganxxat1v.mp3","text":"实际上，老夫光着脚，就能根据地面的振动幅度来测量敌人的距离，这样也能更容易掌握敌人的方位。","alt":"voice_cn/char_503_rang/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2d/e1zn05ywj56bb9avmccnx3tvk9e3qrz.mp3","text":"哈......打呼噜可不好，会被其他巡林者听见的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_503_rang/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:2/29/lxqbyy8tdsm551cqzr3mhc8cd6ksyc4.mp3","text":"狙击干员巡林者，等候差遣。","alt":"voice_cn/char_503_rang/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4b/rwn2zchf4qfbijv64aieprbp9mmdezt.mp3","text":"真不错。","alt":"voice_cn/char_503_rang/cn_012.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:7/79/nlnruqfhpmicubhnvtzxaw2h1vdhs78.mp3","text":"轮到老夫我出场了吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_503_rang/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:2/27/htw6ha16hq0i9f1k9ejk0iqeey9hk6n.mp3","text":"好，老夫我大展身手的时候到了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_503_rang/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7b/jol74pmyopf4y549ch2qlvspqkzrayj.mp3","text":"出发了！","alt":"voice_cn/char_503_rang/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:6/62/o7g09q5bcy10fg1az1txvm9zf5n13p2.mp3","text":"我看到猎物了，作战开始。","alt":"voice_cn/char_503_rang/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:2/25/6mm2vesp95wo2obargbrck5tlix4zbn.mp3","text":"请您吩咐。","alt":"voice_cn/char_503_rang/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/5b/fgbzj7msdkmdgd58er5thacvjhrfe07.mp3","text":"有什么命令？","alt":"voice_cn/char_503_rang/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f0/h26i19uvfy8va2yj07lg3ta0fp5ed1v.mp3","text":"好。","alt":"voice_cn/char_503_rang/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a9/c9mgjvd4swdb04dzzsoas8bc9tohduv.mp3","text":"知道了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_503_rang/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0c/au7loxoe9dcprk97h2x6kv5fqi2q16j.mp3","text":"我看到你了！","alt":"voice_cn/char_503_rang/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c0/31ey0orwrn6ekj3xteb25wb79krdblm.mp3","text":"尝尝老夫这一箭！","alt":"voice_cn/char_503_rang/cn_026.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8d/duzm0chpnut595g9jqaie18iavf2qnt.mp3","text":"无穷无尽的挑战哪，这正是咱们一直期望的不是吗，黑角？","alt":"voice_cn/char_503_rang/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:5/52/35eqzsur1ocse3sb15l9w2l86gsrqkc.mp3","text":"真是一场酣畅淋漓的战斗！","alt":"voice_cn/char_503_rang/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ed/hf9lue7g3idv1fmwpjjos3tk9unyk3m.mp3","text":"有得有失，马马虎虎吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_503_rang/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e7/onmkmguz9befirsdd5nykwec5jvvko0.mp3","text":"糟糕啊......呼吸乱了......","alt":"voice_cn/char_503_rang/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:9/97/291lzoy0x0jc4v6rvjse4cb0u99yg6s.mp3","text":"想要老夫我做什么，请不必顾虑，尽管说。","alt":"voice_cn/char_503_rang/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:5/59/bqko0pn5s8vano6t9300315hwmqe9qz.mp3","text":"尾巴，可别拽断了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_503_rang/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:4/43/9g1dgpvjvgfjd71mtnfewfwuelb6qsu.mp3","text":"没想到您居然好这口。","alt":"voice_cn/char_503_rang/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:9/96/owiq4c905pvain6ujlrnkcru50m9acy.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_503_rang/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:d/dc/pxpx7mg0q95ndnxwfjv1oekew2m89mj.mp3","text":"博士，他们正吵着还要继续听老夫讲故事，帮忙劝劝吧，已经三个小时了啊......年轻人在新年这一天的活力果然非比寻常，比不了了......","alt":"voice_cn/char_503_rang/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b4/7a011fzp6ebq8b1q59qt69vdlolw3gb.mp3","text":"博士，有什么事？","alt":"voice_cn/char_503_